        "id": "maxim:medicine:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "medicine",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "medicine",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "00 - Medicine and Pharmacology Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nRoutes and bioavailability (F):\n  IV:     F = 100% (definition)\n  IM/SC:  F = 75–100% (bypasses gut)\n  PO:     Variable; limited by:\n    ├── GI absorption (solubility, permeability, transporters)\n    ├── Gut wall metabolism (CYP3A4 in enterocytes)\n    └── First-pass hepatic metabolism (portal circulation → liver)"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#012",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:medicine:00-overview, git-history:medicine:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "medicine/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "medicine/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:medicine:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "medicine",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "medicine",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "00 - Medicine and Pharmacology Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "First-pass effect:\n  PO drug → portal vein → liver → CYP metabolism before systemic circulation\n  High first-pass drugs need large PO dose or alternative route\n  Examples: nitroglycerin (SL), morphine (IV > PO), lidocaine (IV only),\n            testosterone (injectable/transdermal — extensive gut/liver metabolism)"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#013",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
