        "module": "medicine",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "medicine",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "00 - Medicine and Pharmacology Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nRenal clearance:\n  CLrenal = GFR × fu − Treabsorption + Tsecretion\n  (fu = unbound fraction; tubular secretion via OAT/OCT transporters)\n  Drugs eliminated renally: dose-reduce in CKD (metformin, digoxin, aminoglycosides)"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#026",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:medicine:00-overview, git-history:medicine:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "medicine/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "medicine/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:medicine:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "medicine",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "medicine",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "00 - Medicine and Pharmacology Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Half-life (t½):\n  t½ = 0.693 × Vd / CL\n  Time to steady state: 4–5 × t½\n  Time to elimination: ~4–5 × t½ (97% eliminated at 5 × t½)"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#027",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:medicine:00-overview, git-history:medicine:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "medicine/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "medicine/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:medicine:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "medicine",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "medicine",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "00 - Medicine and Pharmacology Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Steady-state concentration:\n  Css = Dose rate / (CL)    (for continuous infusion)\n  Css = F × Dose / (CL × τ) (for multiple dosing, τ = dosing interval)\n  Depends only on clearance and dosing rate — NOT on Vd"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#028",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:medicine:00-overview, git-history:medicine:00-overview]",
        "canonical_path": "medicine/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "concepts": "[overview]",
        "current_path": "medicine/00-OVERVIEW.md",
        "id": "maxim:medicine:overview",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "medicine",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "medicine",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "00 - Medicine and Pharmacology Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Zero-order vs first-order kinetics:\n  First-order (most drugs): rate ∝ concentration → constant t½, predictable\n  Zero-order (saturable): constant rate regardless of concentration\n    Alcohol, phenytoin, salicylates (at high doses)\n    → Small dose increase → large plasma concentration increase → toxicity\n```"
    },
