        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "00 - Medicine and Pharmacology Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nG protein-coupled receptors (GPCRs): 7-TM domains\n  Gs → ↑ adenylyl cyclase → ↑ cAMP (β-adrenergic, glucagon, TSH)\n  Gi → ↓ adenylyl cyclase → ↓ cAMP (α2-adrenergic, opioids, M2)\n  Gq → ↑ PLCβ → ↑ IP3/DAG → ↑ Ca²⁺ (α1, M1/M3, H1, AT1)"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#033",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
