        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "00 - Medicine and Pharmacology Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Ion channel receptors (ligand-gated): fastest response (ms)\n  nAChR, GABA-A, NMDA, 5-HT3 — direct ion flow"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#034",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
