      "text": "```\nLog-dose vs response curve (sigmoidal):"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#038",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
