        "title": "00 - Medicine and Pharmacology Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Therapeutic index (TI) = TD50 / ED50\n  (median toxic dose / median effective dose)\n  Wide TI: penicillin (very safe)\n  Narrow TI: digoxin, warfarin, lithium, aminoglycosides, phenytoin, theophylline\n  → Narrow TI drugs require monitoring (drug levels)\n```"
    },
